{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1301.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"ca2b418abfd4130f6b96463c6375b5e9ee7a14fecfaaf2ac5c5f3f657655fc64","ja":"戦いとその後……","zh":"战斗以及之后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1301.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"38cb91a8a20bc287d90031bc43f08570d079ae8897007486289e698e54559b95","ja":"そして、本番当日。\n両チームのダンスが終わって……","zh":"然后，到了正式演出当天。\n两队的舞蹈表演都结束后……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1301.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"34de68ef5272610456185e8de743ccfefd8b01eb72c100a95fec85069c046464","ja":"「接戦を制したのは……プロダンサーチームです！\nおめでとうございます！！」","zh":"「赢得这场势均力敌之战的是……专业舞者队！\n恭喜各位！！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1301.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"9a379dd806eda03eec9fae8b3360532d0cd5de9c42d05458e8572469bef5bfcd","ja":"わぁぁぁぁぁーーーっ！！！","zh":"哇啊啊啊啊啊——！！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1301.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"605f881c09b0e8ff2f08c7f2c87047a8a85a8abcce2c83296df69ee2829c4f0a","ja":"はぁ……おしかったわね。\n500点満点中の5点差で負けなんて……。","zh":"唉……真可惜呢。\n满分500分，居然只差了5分就输了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1301.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"18094dfdd437005c5139354416cf612df805b555989cca3dd90903f36723e34c","ja":"でも、私たちのダンスがプロに通用したって\nことですよね！　それに、次は負けません！","zh":"不过，这也说明我们的舞蹈能得到专业认可了\n对吧！而且，下次我们绝对不会输！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1301.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"ccc1a3a1dce539d9c48232a0ae6b31972ae5ce36c1eae692e71c2ce57aa1d2ee","ja":"紗代子ちゃん……そうよね！　\nもし次があったら、勝つのは私たちよね！","zh":"纱代子……说得对！　\n如果还有下次，赢的一定会是我们！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1301.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"b501c7fab7cc45f29976cb88943ab2a2cddf6a6f9ce596391a2a468e7c93a60c","ja":"そのためにも、みんなのダンスを見直して、\nブラッシュアップしなきゃな。","zh":"为此，必须重新审视大家的舞蹈，\n进一步打磨才行呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1301.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"133f66399c7f2237766323ed280422e33485ea2e7987dc14efbe901ba5d357cc","ja":"ああ、次は絶対負けないぜ！\n……まあ、次がいつあるかわかんないけどさ。","zh":"啊啊，下次绝对不会输的！\n……不过嘛，虽然不知道下次是什么时候就是了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1301.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"95a0df385cf8ff8aa2c41444aebfd6c99ae774ad9c861dde36fa628a6410d33e","ja":"あら、それなら大丈夫よ。\nさっきスタッフに聞いたんだけど……。","zh":"哎呀，那个的话没问题哦。\n我刚才问过工作人员了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1301.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"d783a0895cdfbe4e3601bf360f179c93c58e06880274984851413486ecfcdc67","ja":"また対戦して欲しいんだって。私たちが\nダンス一本で勝負したことに、感動したそうよ♪","zh":"对方说还想再跟我们切磋呢。似乎是对我们\n只凭舞蹈一决胜负的做法，深受感动哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1301.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"e48b3b99a800e7b16a99cdd954fbbb94fecba9d0038eab8611ffdf820d9c90af","ja":"……ははっ！　オレたちが頑張ったの、\n認めてくれたんだな♪","zh":"……哈哈！你认可了\n我们的努力呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1301.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"7ab20dbe0044dc19fcca32e47e0f302c8aedcc72f1038e5e45dde20654989590","ja":"ああ。それに、ダンスに絞ったことで、\n確実にスキルアップしてるからね。","zh":"嗯。而且，正因为集中在舞蹈上，\n水平确实有了提升呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1301.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"630656d6e82e2fcfa13b8b4eee2f785e4552d5f93b2121ba882df6d1c2dc9d99","ja":"今度こそ、みんなの……いや、\nアイドルのすごさを見せてやるよっ！","zh":"这次一定要让大家见识到……不对，\n是见识到偶像的厉害之处！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
